        "title": "Critical Infrastructure Sectors",
        "category": "other"
      },
      {
        "text": "SmileCDR HAPI FHIR contains multiple vulnerabilities. In the worst case, a user could read or write content in a tenant partition that they should not have access to, or an unauthenticated user could trigger a denial-of-service.",
        "title": "Risk Evaluation",
        "category": "summary"
      },
      {
        "text": "Update to most recent available version of HAPI FHIR.",
        "title": "Recommended Practices",
        "category": "general"
      },
      {
        "text": "United States",
        "title": "Company Headquarters Location",
        "category": "other"
      }
